The Crow is a fantasy, action, thriller film directed by Alex Proyas.

3
00:13:18,260 --> 00:13:24,260
Exactly one year after young rock guitarist Eric Draven and his fiancée are brutally killed by a ruthless gang
of criminals, Draven, watched over by a hypnotic crow, returns from the grave to exact revenge.

4
